A repeated opening token stays in that opening run. Quoted key colons,
indented/object-field colons, arrows and loop-binding 'in' get smaller
responses. A document-opening 'Title:' label gets a moderate response.
Remaining token-specific strength variation is deliberately left unmodeled.
