last letter with the next word is much more negative, especially for tabs.
Indentation is stronger near the beginning of a document/packed row.
Closing quotes after escaped newlines are positive. Heuristics distinguish
TeX command names from whitespace escapes. Hex-escape boundaries and format-string endings receive
smaller corrections. Strengths approximate training averages, not exact values.
