Use English corpus word frequencies to compare longer completions of a spelling
with the spelling as a complete word. Short unfamiliar spellings also receive
positive values. Track the current letter run so ordinary word endings are not
mistaken for new fragments. Non-English letters use their script's word counts.
Boost short consonant clusters and capitalized pieces; reduce contractions and
