Construction/development (建设) is strongest, especially political or
ideological construction. Larger tokens containing the word are weaker.
Crafting/cultivation and colouring/infection are secondary lexical groups.
Several words are split across tokens, so retain a short byte suffix and
recognize their endings. Unlisted words receive zero, not a dense token table.
Medical characters or Japanese kana lower the infection-word prediction;
Korean 감염 ('infection') receives a strong response. There are small
exceptions for backstroke and an opening, empty // comment line.
This is a partial lexical approximation; many smaller responses are unmodeled.
