"""Recognize indentation and declaration starts in printed or escaped source code.

The main signal is a tab after a printed line number: tab-plus-spaces is
stronger than a bare tab. Indented variable declarations, escaped indentation,
and repeated nonbreaking spaces receive smaller positive values. Other text
is near zero, with a small negative offset at the start of each document.
