Emit zero except at a row/document's first token. At that token, distinguish
chat boundaries, source-code openers, whitespace, punctuation and scripts.
For Latin words, use English commonness, case and a few function-word classes.
These are approximate strengths fitted on training starts, not token-ID rules;
token-specific variation and small later-token responses are left unexplained.
