"""A lexical equation detector, with short mathematical-phrase continuations.

Equation names produce a strong negative response, especially when the
spelling is assembled across tokens. Abbreviations, near spellings and
some non-English equation/equality words are recognized too. Smaller
responses cover reactions, inequalities and unknowns. The following
'of', 'for', or equation number can retain part of the response.
Repeated middle-dot filler has a separate negative response. A positive
side response recognizes Vietnamese 'phương thức' (method or mode).
